  "title": "Unified AI Models for Audio-Video Generation and Editing",
  "summary": "Unified AI Models for Audio-Video Generation and Editing demonstrate improved performance and robustness across benchmarks, with methods like TORUS, JoVA, and OmniVAE achieving significant advancements in audio-visual synthesis. These models address challenges in continuous synthesis, causal continuity, and multi-modal orchestration.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "TORUS evaluates self-coherence in unified audio models, JoVA unifies joint video-audio generation and editing with native multimodal learning, and OmniVAE enhances audio-video joint generation through cross-modal alignment.",
